Third-party notices
===================

Juling Runtime (oh-my-pi)
-------------------------
The signed Runtime executable shipped with this product (`juling` /
`juling.exe`, installed under `runtime/versions/`) is a modified build of
[oh-my-pi](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi), pinned at commit
`04cd1a7549a02d62ad1d24826198d52507595683` and vendored in this repository as
the Git submodule `omp-patch/vendor/oh-my-pi`. Harness applies an overlay
(`omp-patch/overlay/`) and a small set of seam patches
(`omp-patch/patches/`) to that tree in order to expose a typed Harness Bridge
(`juling --mode harness-host`).

oh-my-pi is a fork of Pi by Mario Zechner.

